{"sha": "477aeaf552a62119b74dfecfd6c1a043f4ccb456ee2bd97e239ed63a22112441", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[法向力与摩擦力]\\label{def:g12:newtons-laws:friction}", "一个表面通过两个分量作用于物体：\\emph{法向力}\\index{法向力", "} $\\vect N$ 垂直于表面，摩擦力 $\\vect f$ 与表面相切。", "实验给出摩擦定律：物体未滑动时，静摩擦力自行调节，", "直至达到上限，$f_s \\leq \\mu_s N$；物体一旦滑动，动摩擦力", "为 $f_k = \\mu_k N$，方向与滑动方向相反。\\emph{摩擦因数}%", "\\index{摩擦因数} $\\mu_s$ 与 $\\mu_k$（$\\mu_k \\leq \\mu_s$）", "仅取决于两种材料。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[斜面问题两次求解]\\label{ex:g12:newtons-laws:incline}", "一个物块沿倾角为 $\\alpha$ 的斜面滑下；坐标轴：$x$ 沿斜面向下，", "$y$ 轴垂直于斜面。对 $y$ 方向：$N = mg\\cos\\alpha$。不计摩擦时，对 $x$ 方向：$ma = mg\\sin\\alpha$，", "于是 $a = g\\sin\\alpha$ --- 与质量无关；当 $\\alpha = 30^\\circ$ 时，$a = \\qty{4.9}{m/s^2}$。", "若计入动摩擦力，则 $a = g(\\sin\\alpha - \\mu_k\\cos\\alpha)$；取 $\\mu_k = 0.20$，", "$a = 9.81\\,(0.500 - 0.173) = \\qty{3.2}{m/s^2}$。物块原本之所以能静止，", "只有在所需的静摩擦力不超过其上限时才成立：$\\tan\\alpha \\leq \\mu_s$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[gray!60] (-0.3,0) -- (6.4,0); \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (30:6.2);", "  \\draw (1.6,0) arc (0:30:1.6); \\node at (14:2.0) {$\\alpha$};", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(30:3.6)}, rotate=30]", "    \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (-0.6,0) rectangle (0.6,0.75);", "    \\coordinate (G) at (0,0.375); \\fill (G) circle (1.5pt);", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, dashed, thick] (G) -- ++(-2.3,0) node[above] {$x$};", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, dashed, thick] (G) -- ++(0,1.9) node[right] {$y$};", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (G) -- ++(0,1.5) node[left] {$\\vect N$};", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (G) -- ++(1.35,0) node[above] {$\\vect f$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (G) -- ++(0,-1.9) node[below] {$\\vect P$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, dashed] (G) -- ++(210:0.95) (G) -- ++(-60:1.645);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 斜面上的受力图：重力 $\\vect P$、法向力 $\\vect N$，", "摩擦力 $\\vect f$ 沿斜面向上（物块下滑时）。沿斜面与垂直斜面的", "坐标轴将 $\\vect P$ 分解为 $mg\\sin\\alpha$ 与 $mg\\cos\\alpha$（虚线）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[视重]\\label{def:g12:newtons-laws:apparent}", "物体的\\emph{视重}\\index{视重}是物体与其支持物之间的", "法向力 --- 即其下方秤的示数。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[电梯]\\label{ex:g12:newtons-laws:elevator}", "一名 \\qty{70}{kg} 的乘客站在电梯中的秤上，电梯竖直方向的加速度为", "$a_z$（取向上为正）：$N - mg = ma_z$，于是 $N = m(g + a_z)$。向上加速时，", "$a_z = \\qty{1.5}{m/s^2}$，示数 \\qty{792}{N}，显得较重；接近顶层减速时，示数 \\qty{582}{N}，显得较轻；", "匀速运行时：$mg = \\qty{687}{N}$ --- 此即牛顿第一定律；自由落体时，$a_z = -g$：", "$N = 0$，秤上读数为零，即完全失重。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[两个物块与一个滑轮]\\label{ex:g12:newtons-laws:pulley}", "放在光滑桌面上的一个物块 $m_1 = \\qty{4.0}{kg}$，通过一根轻绳，跨过", "一个理想滑轮，与悬挂的物块 $m_2 = \\qty{1.0}{kg}$ 相连。绳子在两端传递", "相同的张力 $T$；两物块的加速度大小相同，均为 $a$。", "对每个物块沿其运动方向分别应用牛顿第二定律：$m_1 a = T$ 与 $m_2 a = m_2 g - T$，于是", "$a = m_2\\,g/(m_1 + m_2) = \\qty{1.96}{m/s^2}$，并且 $T = m_1 a = \\qty{7.8}{N}$ ---", "小于 $m_2 g = \\qty{9.8}{N}$，这正是 $m_2$ 向下加速所必需的。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.95, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.1) -- (4.0,1.1); \\draw (0.4,1.1) -- (0.4,-0.4) (3.6,1.1) -- (3.6,-0.4);", "  \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (1.0,1.1) rectangle (2.0,1.75); \\node at (1.5,1.42) {$m_1$};", "  \\draw (4.0,1.1) -- (4.25,1.35);", "  \\draw[fill=white] (4.25,1.35) circle (0.25); \\fill (4.25,1.35) circle (1.2pt);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.0,1.6) -- (4.25,1.6) (4.5,1.35) -- (4.5,0.15);", "  \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (4.2,-0.45) rectangle (4.8,0.15); \\node at (4.5,-0.15) {$m_2$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (2.0,1.42) -- ++(1.2,0) node[pos=0.8, below] {$\\vect T$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (4.5,0.15) -- ++(0,0.85) node[right] {$\\vect T$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (4.5,-0.15) -- ++(0,-1.1) node[right] {$\\vect P_2$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (1.1,2.15) -- ++(0.8,0) node[right] {$\\vect a$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (5.4,0.4) -- ++(0,-0.8) node[below] {$\\vect a$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个物块、一根轻绳、一个理想滑轮：相同的张力 $T$ 同时拉住两端，", "两物块加速度大小相同 --- 每个物块应用一次牛顿第二定律，得到两个", "方程，两个未知数。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[水平弯道]\\label{ex:g12:newtons-laws:curve}", "质量为 $m$ 的汽车驶过半径为 $R$ 的水平弯道，速率恒为 $v$。在", "弗勒内标架（见\\cref{ch:g12:kinematics-2d}）中，加速度纯为法向，", "$a_N = v^2/R$，指向圆心。竖直方向上，$N = mg$；水平方向上，唯一可用的", "向心力是路面作用于轮胎的静摩擦力：", "$f = mv^2/R \\leq \\mu_s N = \\mu_s mg$，于是 $v \\leq \\sqrt{\\mu_s\\, g R}$，", "与质量无关。取 $R = \\qty{90}{m}$，干燥路面（$\\mu_s = 0.70$）：", "$v_{\\max} \\approx \\qty{25}{m/s}$（\\qty{89}{km/h}）；在冰面上，上限骤降 ---", "见\\cref{exo:g12:newtons-laws:13}，路面做成倾斜的；见\\cref{exo:g12:newtons-laws:10}，", "同一投影思路用于绳上的摆动。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[gray!50, dashed] (0,0) circle (2.1); \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (0,0) -- (150:2.1) node[midway, above] {$R$};", "  \\draw[fill=omExo!15, rotate around={90:(2.1,0)}] (1.6,-0.28) rectangle (2.6,0.28);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (2.1,0.55) -- ++(0,1.4) node[above] {$\\vect v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (2.38,0) -- ++(-1.45,0) node[pos=0.85, above] {$\\vect f$};", "  \\node at (0.2,-2.7) {俯视图};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.5,0) -- (3.7,0); \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (0.9,0.42) rectangle (2.5,1.25);", "  \\draw[fill=white] (1.2,0.42) circle (0.26) (2.2,0.42) circle (0.26);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (1.7,0.85); \\fill (C) circle (1.2pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (C) -- ++(0,1.4) node[above] {$\\vect N$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (C) -- ++(0,-1.7) node[below] {$\\vect P$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (C) -- ++(-1.6,0) node[above] {$\\vect f$};", "  \\node at (1.6,-2.7) {后视图（中心在左侧）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}